# rhost.py probe --target wine tests/probes/crt-dbgheap.probe (docs/findings/crt-gap-dbgheap.md). $N refers to call
# line N (comments not counted): inserting a line renumbers the references after it.
scenario newgame-playnow
# the debug heap's check / realloc / dump paths and the sbh internals (rl_crt_dbgheap.c) on the strategic map
# (frame 1700, the debug heap live). $N = the value call line N returned (counted from 1, file order); [X] = the
# dword at X. Scratch S (128 B): +0 / +4 the saved _pFirstBlock / _pLastBlock, +8 a _CrtMemState, +64 the saved
# _pfnAllocHook, +68 a hook value, +72 the saved sbh rover.
1700 rl_crt_4bfa30 128 1 0 0
1700 rl_crt_4c3220 $1 va:0x4e5b28 4
1700 rl_crt_4c3220 $1+4 va:0x4e5b20 4
